### States

| Story | What it shows |
| --- | --- |
| Empty | Notes + unanswered chip banks |
| In progress (AI generating) | Chips complete; AI loading |
| Filled | AI follow-up ready |
| Worst case (Other everywhere) | Other text + escalation path |

